  "overview": "Gut Popping Swordplay\n\nYour patch o' paradise is being demolished by mobs of hungry hordlings.\n\n- Annihilate the horde with your morningstar, bombs or trusty sword\n- Build your defenses - dig death pits, hire archers and knights\n- Mouth-watering 3D texture-mapped characters\n- 35 minutes of hilarious video\n\n昔むかし、剣と魔法とそして魔物がいた時代。\n\n都市育成＆シミュレーション＋リアルタイム・アクション"
